            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Ting 0.7.11

- Selecta now shows its menu immediately by default. An explicitly configured delay is unchanged; adjust **Settings › General › Show menu after** to hide the menu during fast sequences.
- Ting now sends the application launch or activation request before playing the launch sound, so switching apps does not wait for audio playback.
]]></description>
